{title: I love my Savior too –}
{subtitle: Hymnal 332}

{comment: Chorus}
I love my Savior, He loves me too
I’ll seek His favor, in everything that I do

{comment: Verse 1}
Jesus, my heavenly King, loves me I know
Praises to Him I sing, onward I go
Closely to Him I cling, blessing still flow
I love my Savior too

{comment: Verse 2}
Walking with Him each day, love light doth shine
Doing His will always, never repine
Kneeling to Him I pray, “Thy will not mine”
I love my Savior too

{comment: Verse 3}
Happy to serve my friend, lean on His arm
Rapture will never end, Nothing alarm
Voices will sweetly blend, under His charm
I love my Savior too
